# Space definition validation

When adding a new Space definition type, or a new JSON record of an existing Space def, stop and ask before writing the files:

- which fields are required;
- which checks must be added to `Assets/Modules/Space/Scripts/Editor/Cheats/SpaceDefinitionsValidation.cs`.

When adding or changing a field on a Space def that already exists, ask whether the validator needs a new check. Do not invent the check and do not skip the question.

The button **Test definitions** in `Tools/Space` is a report. It does not decide `SpaceDefinitionsManager.IsReady`. A new required field is not automatically a startup failure unless that is stated separately.

Document a new check in `.cursor/docs/modules/SpaceDefs.md`, section «Проверка дефов кнопкой».
